questions.model:
n=0直接返回；k%=n。先逆置前k项，再逆置剩余n-k项，再逆置整体，AB经A逆B逆再整体逆得到BA。k=0时两次整段逆置仍正确，可直接返回。O(n)时间，O(1)辅助空间。

参考实现：
```c
static void reversePart(unsigned char s[],int l,int r){while(l<r){unsigned char x=s[l];s[l++]=s[r];s[r--]=x;}}
void rotateLeft(unsigned char s[],int n,unsigned int k){if(!n)return;k%=(unsigned)n;int p=(int)k;reversePart(s,0,p-1);reversePart(s,p,n-1);reversePart(s,0,n-1);}
```
